Rule space: confidence (horizontal axis) vs. lift (vertical axis), with support encoded in marker size and lift in color. The dashed red line marks lift = 1, the boundary of statistical independence. Rules below this line are spurious or trivial. Hovering over any point reveals the complete rule.
:::
